{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Memories</strong> is an episodic psychological horror series where each episode <strong>reveals</strong> a chilling story told by those who <i>barely escaped with their sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Buried Memories] Left on Read</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067570/extras/428563471d9bdfe725101dc23744f206.poster.avif?t=1767539069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067570/extras/428563471d9bdfe725101dc23744f206.webm?t=1767539069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067570/extras/428563471d9bdfe725101dc23744f206.mp4?t=1767539069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s 2014. Nolan Frost, a teenager, sets out for a late-night bike ride home, but the night takes a far darker turn. Between family chats, group texts, and a chilling message from an unknown sender, every choice could cost lives. Protect your baby brother, survive the night, and confront the terror waiting just outside your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative experience featuring bicycle rides, cooking and feeding a toddler, exploration, puzzle-solving, conversation mechanics, and unexpected jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and immersive storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Scares.</p></l